<title>POLAND: Agros plans new share issue.</title>
<headline>Agros plans new share issue.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish food trader and producer Agros SA plans a new share issue, ex-rights, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>It gave no further details and company officials were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>The management's proposal has yet to be approved by general shareholders meeting on November 22.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
